  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3789,
      "text": "By those [angels] lined up in rows,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3790,
      "text": "and those who drive [the clouds],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3791,
      "text": "and those who recite Allah’s words[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3792,
      "text": "indeed, your God is One,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3793,
      "text": "Lord of the heavens and earth and all that is between them, and Lord of the points of sunrise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3794,
      "text": "We have adorned the sky with the beauty of the stars,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3795,
      "text": "and for safeguarding it against every rebellious devil,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3796,
      "text": "so that they cannot eavesdrop on the highest assembly [of angels] and are pelted from every side[2]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3797,
      "text": "to repel them; and for them there will be a perpetual punishment,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3798,
      "text": "except who stealthily snatches away some words, he will be pursued by a piercing flame.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3799,
      "text": "So ask them, “Are they more difficult to create or other things We created? We created them[3] from sticky clay.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3800,
      "text": "Rather you are astonished, while they ridicule it,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3801,
      "text": "and when they are reminded, they pay no heed,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3802,
      "text": "and when they see a sign, they ridicule it,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3803,
      "text": "and they say, “This is nothing but clear magic.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3804,
      "text": "Is it that when we are dead and become dust and bones, will we really be raised up again,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3805,
      "text": "and our forefathers too?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3806,
      "text": "Say, “Yes, and you will be disgraced.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3807,
      "text": "It will only be a single Blast[4], and at once they will be looking around.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3808,
      "text": "They will say, “Woe to us! This is the Day of Judgment!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3809,
      "text": "[They will be told], “This is the Day of Decision that you used to deny.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 386,
      "hizbQuarter": 178,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3810,
      "text": "[The angels will be told], “Gather all those who did wrong and their fellows[5], and whatever they used to worship",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3811,
      "text": "besides Allah, and lead them to the way of Hell,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 446,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3812,
      "text": "and stop them, for they are to be questioned.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
